Terminology (user preference)
module = CEL CMP9611 (NXP IW611; identifies internally as SDIW612).
som = Ka-Ro QSXP-ML81.
i.MX = the i.MX8M Plus chip.
Always give i.MX pins with their som pin, e.g. GPIO5_IO22 (som:p93), or (NC) if not connected to a som pin.
All schematic pin numbers are som pins unless prefixed module:.
